# Only the prebuilt runtime and public assets can enter this build context.
**
!Dockerfile.cloud-run
!.next/
!.next/standalone/
!.next/standalone/**
!.next/static/
!.next/static/**
!public/
!public/**

# Defense in depth against credentials or local data copied by tracing.
**/.env*
**/gha-creds-*.json
**/.git
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
